# ARCH-EP-000 — Enterprise Architecture Integration Model

**Project:** BTA V5.1 — HCGO Enterprise Architecture

**Status:** Approved

**Classification:** Methodology Governance

---

# Purpose

Establish the constitutional integration model governing the HCGO Enterprise Architecture methodology.

The Enterprise Architecture Integration Model does not introduce another architectural phase.

It integrates the approved architectural phases into one authoritative constitutional methodology while preserving enterprise authority, enterprise semantics, governance, traceability, and technology independence.

---

# Architecture Objective

Establish the authoritative integration model governing the relationships between every Enterprise Architecture phase across HCGO.

The Enterprise Architecture Integration Model shall identify:

- Architectural phase responsibilities
- Architectural phase dependencies
- Architectural phase authority
- Architectural phase information flow
- Architectural phase traceability
- Architectural phase governance
- Architectural phase transition boundaries
- Architectural dependency relationships

The Enterprise Architecture Integration Model remains:

- Enterprise-level
- Technology independent
- Domain independent
- Implementation independent
- Runtime independent

