# Architectural Integration Principles

Every architectural phase shall faithfully represent the authoritative outcomes established by the previous phase.

Architectural integration shall never transfer architectural authority.

Architectural representation shall never redefine enterprise semantics.

Architectural progression shall preserve enterprise traceability.

Architectural integration shall preserve enterprise governance.

Architectural integration shall preserve enterprise ownership.

Architectural integration shall preserve enterprise stewardship.

Architectural integration shall preserve enterprise lifecycle authority.

Technology Implementation shall faithfully implement the approved Enterprise Architecture without redefining it.

---

# Architectural Dependency Model

The Enterprise Architecture Integration Model shall identify:

- Governs
- Supplies
- Constrains
- Depends Upon
- Produces
- Consumed By

These relationships describe architectural integration.

They do not describe runtime execution or implementation dependencies.

